# Generated by `pnpm generate:api` from the backend OpenAPI spec; prettier must
# not fight the generator. The spec itself is committed in some apps and not
# others — ignoring it everywhere costs nothing and stops it drifting back.
src/lib/api/openapi.json
src/lib/api/schema.d.ts

# The design gates rewrite these with their own JSON layout on `--baseline`.
# Reformatting them turns every banked finding into a two-tool diff.
.design-craft-baseline.json
.ui-drift-baseline.json

# ============================================================================
# App-owned
# ============================================================================
# Prettier has no include directive, so this is the extension point: everything
# above is the factory's and is compared byte-for-byte, everything below is this
# app's. What belongs here is a path only this app has — a second build output,
# a generated source tree, hand-aligned fixture JSON a reformat would destroy.
# One reason per line, so a stale rule can be retired by someone who did not add it.
# App-owned below this line; the factory owns everything above it.
